12. Key Business Questions Answered

The dashboard answers several important business questions:

Which Sales Managers achieved their targets?
Which Sales Team generated the highest revenue?
Which countries contributed the highest sales?
Which order source is most popular?
Which customer category generated the highest sales?
Which customers did not place any orders?
Which months experienced peak sales?
Which Sales POCs exceeded their targets?
Which country had the highest average order value?
13. Business Insights

Examples of insights include:

Website and Mobile App generated the majority of orders.
Certain countries contributed significantly more revenue than others.
A few Sales Managers consistently exceeded their sales targets.
Customer purchasing behavior varied across categories.
Monthly sales showed seasonal trends.
Some Sales Teams required additional support to achieve targets.

