14. Business Recommendations
Focus marketing efforts on the highest-performing order channels.
Provide coaching and incentives to underperforming Sales Teams.
Expand successful sales strategies to lower-performing regions.
Retain high-value customers through loyalty programs.
Monitor order source data quality to prevent future system issues.
Review sales targets periodically to ensure they remain realistic and achievable.
