Publish dashboards to the Power BI Service for organization-wide access.
18. Conclusion

This project demonstrates the end-to-end development of a business intelligence solution using Power BI. By cleaning and modeling data, creating meaningful DAX measures, and building interactive dashboards, the project provides actionable insights into sales performance, customer behavior, and target achievement. The solution supports informed decision-making, enabling stakeholders to identify growth opportunities, improve sales strategies, and monitor key business metrics effectively.
